          "title": "GAME DESIGN TEAM REQUESTS",
          "body": "# GAME DESIGNERS REQUESTING HELP RE: EARLY PRODUCT QA\n@joshua\n- [9:48 AM] do you think you can help us communicate this with Adam and the art Qa team?\n- [9:48 AM] They are sharing beta demo for testing to Product team specifically to game design team, but there are plenty of obvious bugs.\n- [9:48 AM] Is there a way for them to test the game quickly and fix those obvious bugs before gd team make a review?\n\n@adam discussed, looking to see if Ivana's partner or Vlad in house has capacity.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] SUGGESTION/CHECKSUM: Do the product team members QA in rounds?",
          "updated": 1785349492
