        {
          "id": "pg-527b4963",
          "position": 5,
          "title": "Active Discussions for Q2 2027 title choices",
          "body": ".format: studio\n[Theme Proposal List](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/19W82aje_MAewQXts9ZeBp3yEq6Ixf7BxaS7AmbAgBwc/edit?usp=sharing)\n\nGOLDEN DRAGON INFERNO 1000 \nConcept Art Direction [LINK](https://betsoft.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/GDD/pages/1829863425/Ultimate+Golden+Dragon+Inferno+1000?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNjBlZmZjZDIwNTBlNDg5ZmIyMmNmMWRhZjg2NTgwNDQiLCJwIjoiY29uZmx1ZW5jZS1jaGF0cy1pbnQifQ)\n\n@Zang Cabael shared concept art for Ultimate Golden Dragon Inferno 1000 for review, and @Anna M provided positive initial feedback. @Arata raised concerns about player engagement with the bet booster feature, suggesting a need to study competitor approaches to make it more appealing and clear to players. @Zang Cabael has agreed to research competitor bet booster designs and incorporate findings into the game's art direction and the company's Game Design Guide and Standards.\n\n--\n\nQ2 suggestions known:\n\nBSGQ2G2 – Replica of Sun of Egypt 5\n • Suggested theme: Gold Nugget Rush 3\n\nBSGQ2G6 – Le Pharaoh (Bonus short cycle version)\n • Suggested theme: Thieves Guild\n\nNGQ2G3 – Clone of Love Potion #9\n • Suggested theme: Do or Diner\n\nBSGQ2G3 – New Mechanics for 3 Pots of Wishes\n • Suggested theme: Pots of Wishes\n\nBSGQ2G4 – New Mechanics; 5 Pots Original (4 Pots Riches + 3 Pots of Olympus)\n • Suggested theme: Garden of Babylon\n\nBSGQ2G7 – Semi-Clone of Thunder Coins XXL\n • Suggested theme: SuperNova BSG which features Energy, Cosmic theme. (by Anna)\n\nBSGQ2G8 – Clone of Gold Nugget Rush 2 (from Q3G42026)\n • Suggested theme: High end Jewelry store\n\nBSGQ2G8 – The Aristocrats (Short cycle or math change)\n • Suggested theme: The Samurai\n • Suggested theme: Odin\n • Suggested theme (Alternative): Asian Lucky Cat\n\nBSGQ2G9 – Big Catch (Additional Rules - Multiplier mode style mechanics)\n • Suggested theme: Outlaws vs Enforcer\n",
          "updated": 1785348075
        },
